From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Eduardo Martins <372861+edulmartins@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 13:10:00 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: apple: t8015-x: Power the Wi-Fi endpoint

TEST ONLY. The D221 runtime ADT powers the BCM4357 through SMC PMU GPIO
14 ("gP0e") and drives the device-wake line on AP GPIO 40. Without that
rail the endpoint never answers PERST# and the port's LTSSM stays in
Detect.Quiet.

The active level of gP0e is unverified: every other Apple Wi-Fi REG_ON
in this tree is active-high, and so is the Broadcom WL_REG_ON, but the
ADT's command word for this key reads as a plain 0. Start active-high
and flip only if the port's LTSSM never leaves Detect.Quiet.

Model the rail as a fixed regulator on the SMC PMU GPIO and give the
endpoint a pci-pwrctrl node, which apple-h9p powers before it sets up
the port. The t8015 SMC has no apple,smc-gpio child yet, so add it here.

The endpoint uses the j172 power-control data: the BCM4357's own PCI ID
is still unknown, so the node claims pci14e4,43dc to bind the pwrctrl
driver. Not for submission.

Signed-off-by: Eduardo Martins <372861+edulmartins@users.noreply.github.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8015-x.dtsi | 29 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 29 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8015-x.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8015-x.dtsi
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8015-x.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8015-x.dtsi
@@ -10,6 +10,20 @@
 
 / {
 	chassis-type = "handset";
+
+	/*
+	 * TEST ONLY: the BCM4357's REG_ON is driven through the SMC PMU
+	 * GPIO 14 ("gP0e"). The active level is unverified. gpiolib forces
+	 * the polarity from enable-active-high and ignores the phandle
+	 * flags, so that property alone decides the physical level.
+	 */
+	wlan_vdd: regulator-wlan-vdd {
+		compatible = "regulator-fixed";
+		regulator-name = "wlan-vdd";
+		gpio = <&smc_gpio 14 GPIO_ACTIVE_HIGH>;
+		enable-active-high;
+		off-on-delay-us = <2500>;
+	};
 };
 
 &apcie {
@@ -29,6 +43,13 @@
 		#address-cells = <3>;
 		#size-cells = <2>;
 		ranges;
+
+		wifi@0,0 {
+			compatible = "apple,d221-bcm4357-wifi", "pci14e4,43dc";
+			reg = <0x10000 0x0 0x0 0x0 0x0>;
+			device-wake-gpios = <&pinctrl_ap 40 GPIO_ACTIVE_HIGH>;
+			vdd-supply = <&wlan_vdd>;
+		};
 	};
 };
 
@@ -37,3 +58,11 @@
 		pinmux = <APPLE_PINMUX(163, 1)>;
 	};
 };
+
+&smc {
+	smc_gpio: gpio {
+		compatible = "apple,smc-gpio";
+		gpio-controller;
+		#gpio-cells = <2>;
+	};
+};
-- 
